  "question": {
    "text": "A monoatomic gas at pressure <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and volume <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math> is suddenly compressed to one eighth of its original volume. The final pressure at constant entropy will be",
